endobj
16 0 obj
<</AP<</N 64 0 R >>/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 8392704/MK<<>>/P 10 0 R /Rect[ 129.169998 500.29501 591.51398 541.28601]/Subtype/Widget/T(IC-Purpose)/Type/Annot/V(My goal of this project is to hopefully push for some manner of policy change within AI generation, as \(also hopefully\) showcased through the results of this project. If not, I hope that I could at least bring more of a public awareness as to why AI art is a problem not only for just artists, but our greater society as a whole.\r\n)>>
endobj
17 0 obj
<</AP<</N 67 0 R >>/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 8392704/MK<<>>/P 10 0 R /Rect[ 20.018999 457.87299 592.94397 485.995]/Subtype/Widget/T(IC-Participation)/Type/Annot/V(You will be able to utilize a site in order to vote on which of the 2 presented images is AI-generatedŽand/or fill out a form with questions regarding age range, level of formal education, level of knowledge about AI images, how often they use AI image tools, level of knowledge about art/photography, opinions on AI, and how AI art has affected their lives.)>>
endobj
18 0 obj
<</AP<</N 70 0 R >>/DA(/Helv 12 Tf 0 g)/F 4/FT/Tx/MK<<>>/P 10 0 R /Rect[ 165.395004 430.70499 349.85599 456.92001]/Subtype/Widget/T(IC-Time)/Type/Annot/V(15 mins, more or less)>>
endobj
19 0 obj
<</AP<</N 73 0 R >>/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 8392704/MK<<>>/P 10 0 R /Rect[ 19.5424 397.34 592.94397 423.078]/Subtype/Widget/T(IC-Risks)/Type/Annot/V(Throughout your participation, you may view a disturbing image. We will review every image before allowing it onto the website, but everyone has different triggers that will be impossible for us to completely cover. The risk of a data breach is also minimal considering the services that we use \(mongoDB, Cloudinary, and Google\) are considered to be reputable.)>>
endobj
20 0 obj
<</AP<</N 76 0 R >>/F 4/FT/Tx/Ff 8392704/MK<<>>/P 10 0 R /Rect[ 20.018999 359.20801 593.41998 384.94699]/Subtype/Widget/T(IC-Benefits)/Type/Annot/V(By participating in this study, you are supporting our purpose of pushing towards the cleansing of "AI art slop" from the internet -- our ultimate goal of freeing the internet once more with creativity. )>>
endobj
